 Tags
 Reporting group
 Cost center
 Default attributes
 Default availability policies
 Default approval workflow
 Active/inactive status
Categories may inherit configuration from parent categories.
Administrators should be warned when changing a category used by active resources.
Acceptance Condition
Resources can be grouped into configurable hierarchical categories and subcategories that can subsequently
be used throughout search, scheduling, reporting, automation, and integrations.
