Screen 06 — Recurring Reservation Configuration
Purpose
Allow resources to be reserved repeatedly without creating each reservation individually.
Recurrence Patterns
Support:
 Daily
 Weekly
 Monthly
 Selected weekdays
 Selected dates
 Custom recurrence
Example:
 Meeting Room A
Every Monday and Wednesday
09:00–11:00
1 September–31 December
 Recurrence Controls
Users shall configure:
 Start date
 End date
 Frequency
 Days
 Times
 Number of occurrences
 Resource
 Venue
 Exceptions
 Conflict Handling
Before saving a recurring reservation, TICVAI shall analyze the entire series.
The system shall identify:
 Conflict-free occurrences
 Conflicting occurrences
 Unavailable dates
 Maintenance conflicts
 Venue closure conflicts
Users may:
 Keep resource where available
 Skip conflicting occurrences
 Select alternative resource
