Board 3 — Staff Resource & Workforce 
Configuration
Board Objective
Provide TICVAI with a centralized backend configuration environment for treating employees, 
instructors, contractors, technicians, security personnel, event staff, and other personnel as 
intelligent operational resources.
The board shall establish:
Staff Profile Skills Certifications Qualifications Availability Shifts Breaks/Leave → → → → → → →
Overtime External Workforce Integration →
The objective is not to replace the later operational rostering board. Board 3 defines who the 
employee is, what they are qualified to do, and when they are allowed or available to work.
Operational roster construction, attendance monitoring, shift swaps, staffing gaps, and labor-cost 
management will remain in Board 4 to avoid duplication.
