Board 3 Shared Intelligence Rules
Staff selection throughout TICVAI shall use a common Staff Eligibility Engine.
When evaluating an employee for an assignment, the engine should evaluate:
Availability + Shift + Skills + Certifications + Qualification + Leave + Breaks + Venue + Working 
Hours + Overtime + Assignment Conflicts
The result shall be explainable.
For example:
Maria Garcia — 97% Match
✓ Available
✓ Level 3 Instructor
✓ Certification valid
✓ Correct venue
✓ No overtime
✓ Language match
David Lee — 82% Match
✓ Available
✓ Qualified
✓ Certification valid
⚠ Different venue
⚠ 30-minute transfer required
Alex Johnson — Not Eligible
✕ On approved leave

