 Accessibility
 Approval workflows
 Push notifications
Sensitive information must be limited to what the employee requires to perform the assignment.
Board 9 — Cross-Platform Synchronization
Board 9 shall use the same underlying Resource Management services as:
 Backend Administration
 POS
 B2C
 B2B
 Event Management
 Workforce Management
 Equipment & Asset Management
 AI Resource Intelligence
 APIs
For example:
Manager changes Maria's assignment in Backend
→ Resource Calendar updates
→ Workforce Roster updates
→ Maria's Employee App updates
→ Push notification generated
→ Old resource availability released
→ New resource availability reserved
→ Audit event recorded

